BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230717T113944Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nShaping the Future of Work\nSynopsis\n:\nImagine that
	 the progress of customer requests can be tracked like a parcel from Amazo
	n\, wouldn’t the customer and employee experience be seamless? To realis
	e this vision\, we are equipping the bank with Workflow Workbench by havin
	g consolidating tasks from various systems into a single interface to redu
	ce toil and enable better collaboration.\nSpeaker\n:\nLinda Sim Peng LEE\,
	 Jitendra TEKCHANDANI\, Ee Lin TAN\nJoining Instructions\n(In-Person)\n:\n
	DBS Asia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Marina Bay Financial Centre Tow
	er 3\, Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n
	 \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\, you mu
	st follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs1ban
	k-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZM
	d10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. This will 
	install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming e
	xperience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex Ev
	ents URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e3cf8eeba38e206605d
	89de4272e0e8da> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address and
	 click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Webex Meet
	ings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting &
	 Input Meeting Number: 2514 051 6829\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \nJoin v
	ia Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-3018-
	6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-64
	80-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2514 051 6829\nGlobal call-in 
	numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e676867362e017366
	6ba5856cc26881d5> \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230719T155000
